          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.40.7+JER.40.8+JER.40.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 40.7-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyuuni Babiloni, ka Nebukadreza jed'ani, Gedalia, ilma Ahikamu, ka akhaakhu Shafani, gudda lafa Yuda tolche, ammalle worra Yudati hafe, ka Babiloni ingeesini, kaani mata iti tolche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri askarti Yudati matatifi askartini worra, ta harka inkennatini, waan kana d'ageete jennaani, Mispati goli Gedaliati daramani. Maqaani worra gugurda suni kana: Ishmaeli ilma Nethania, Yohana ilma Karea, Seraya ilma Tanhumethi, ka dira Netafa, ammalle Yezania ilma Maaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedaliani worrati kakhate waan jed'e, Wonti isani worra Babiloni iraa d'eetani injirtu, lafa tanati qubad'a, hayyu Babiloniti hojad'a, akanaani bulti argattani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.41.1+JER.41.2+JER.41.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 41.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo jia torbeeso, ganna suni keesa, Ishmaeli ilmi Nethania, ka akhaakhu Elishana, ka fiit'a hayyu nama kud'ani fud'ate Mispa d'aqe, Gedaliafi worra Israelitiifi ka Babiloni ka isa woliini jirule had'e ijeese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5+JER.43.6+JER.43.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 43.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri Israeli, dureeyyiifi, hiyyeeyifi worri askartiti mataa woliini kaani; maro worra Babiloni sodaatanifi lafa Misiri d'aqani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Yekonia mana hid'ansa keesaa gallakisani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna sodomi torbeeso ka Yekoniani hayyu Yuda boojiani, guyya diddami torbeeso ka jia kud'ani lameeso, Evil-Merodakini hayyu Babiloni tahe, Yekonia hayyu Yudati nahe hid'aansa keesa baase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni Yekonia dubbi dansa iti dubbate, hayyoota isa woliini boojiani taani ch'ufa iraa ulfeese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi Yekoniani woya gaafa isa hid'ani keeyachiisani taani jijirate haga jiru ch'ufa mana hayyu keesa hayyu woliini sagale nyaate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haga inni jiru guyya ch'ufa beese waan isaa male kennaniifi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
